# --- Hand-off documents carrying live credentials --------------------------
# docs/friend-ipv6-over-websocket.md is the shareable build guide for the
# /64-over-WebSocket tunnel. The *implementation* is committed
# (services/friend-tunnel.nix + the friend-router microVM); this file is the
# printable copy that additionally spells out the live shared secrets — the
# wstunnel upgrade path, both public keys, the /64 and what the friend can
# reach — so it stays out of git on purpose. Regenerate it from the config.
/docs/friend-ipv6-over-websocket.md

